|i2 : S = productOfProjectiveSpaces(#L) --creates the multi-graded ring of    |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = S                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|(P^1)^(#L)                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : Delta = smallDiagonal S -- the ideal of the small diagonal of (P^1)^(#L)|
