productOfProjectiveSpaces -- Constructs the multi-graded ring of a product of copies of P^1 (pp is a synonym)
*************************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        R = productOfProjectiveSpaces L
        R = productOfProjectiveSpaces n
  * Inputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of positive integers, the
        dimensions of the projective spaces
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, positive integer, number of P^1
        factors
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * CoefficientField => a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, default value
        ZZ/32003, the ground field
      * VariableName => a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, default value
        "x", name of variable to use.
  * Outputs:
      * R, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, ZZ^n - graded

Description
===========

The variables are in 1+L_i -tuples, x_(i,0).. x_(i,L_i) with degree
{0..0,1,0..0}, the 1 being in the i-th place.

+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = productOfProjectiveSpaces{1,3}                        |
|                                                               |
|o1 = R                                                         |
|                                                               |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                            |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : v = gens R                                                |
|                                                               |
|o2 = {x   , x   , x   , x   , x   , x   }                      |
|       0,0   0,1   1,0   1,1   1,2   1,3                       |
|                                                               |
|o2 : List                                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : v/degree                                                  |
|                                                               |
|o3 = {{1, 0}, {1, 0}, {0, 1}, {0, 1}, {0, 1}, {0, 1}}          |
|                                                               |
|o3 : List                                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : gens productOfProjectiveSpaces({1,1}, VariableName => "y")|
|                                                               |
|o4 = {y   , y   , y   , y   }                                  |
|       0,0   0,1   1,0   1,1                                   |
|                                                               |
|o4 : List                                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : gens productOfProjectiveSpaces 2                          |
|                                                               |
|o5 = {x   , x   , x   , x   }                                  |
|       0,0   0,1   1,0   1,1                                   |
|                                                               |
|o5 : List                                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+

