*********************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        J = schemeInProduct(I,maps,PP)
        J = schemeInProduct(I,maps)
  * Inputs:
      * I, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, defining the source scheme
      * maps, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, list of sequences of
        polynomials each of a single degree, in I
