|i5 : maps = {f0,f1}                             |
|                                                |
|o5 = {| a b |, | a b |}                         |
|                                                |
|o5 : List                                       |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : schemeInProduct(I, maps,VariableName =>"Y")|
|                                                |
|o6 = ideal(Y   Y    - Y   Y   )                 |
|            0,1 1,0    0,0 1,1                  |
|                                                |
|               ZZ                               |
|o6 : Ideal of ---[Y   ..Y   , a..b]             |
